0 kpc away in another direction. The group''s dominant galaxy is the Milky Way, which holds the Sun, 8.18 kpc from its centre.","action":{"kind":"drop_when","columns":["DMzp","e_DMzp"],"when":{"column":"1PGC","is":["5064336"]}}}]');
INSERT INTO sources VALUES(2,6,'researched-structures','Researched structures','literature','cosmic_web','None for the source as a whole: each structure file gives the full citation, with bibcode, of the papers its values come from, and those papers are cited wherever the structure is shown.','structures/','No provider terms: the values are read from published papers, and each structure file cites its papers.','Cite the papers each structure file lists.','permitted_with_credit','provisional',0,'{"method":"repository","path":"structures/"}','["Every structure file under structures/ in this repository; nothing is fetched.","Each structure''s values are read from its papers and keep their kind (measured, estimated or reconstructed), uncertainties and frames as the papers give them."]','[]');
